 "name": "PMEG3015EH-QX",
 "kind": "diode",
 "manufacturer": "Nexperia",
 "title": "Schottky barrier rectifier, 30 V, 1.5 A, ultra low VF, SOD123F",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Product data sheet v.1, 26 June 2023",
  "pages": 8
 },
 "summary": "A single planar Schottky rectifier with a built-in guard ring, in the flat-lead two-terminal SOD123F surface-mount package. It blocks 30 V, is rated 1.5 A forward current with the solder point at or below 55 °C, and drops a typical 440 mV at 1.5 A. It is AEC-Q101 qualified for automotive use. Uses named for it are low-voltage rectification, efficient DC-to-DC conversion, switch-mode supplies, reverse-polarity protection and low-power circuits.",
